      <h2>The Crown Jewel: Dairy Queen's $7 Meal Deal Breakdown</h2>
      <p>The <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">DQ $7 Meal Deal</a> remains one of the few true sub-$10 full-course meals left in fast food. What makes it legendary is that it bundles four complete items together under one flat price:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Entrée:</strong> Your choice of an <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> or 3-Piece All-White Meat Chicken Strips.</li>
        <li><strong>Side:</strong> A serving of hot, crispy Regular Fries.</li>
        <li><strong>Beverage:</strong> A 21 oz fountain soft drink.</li>
        <li><strong>Dessert:</strong> A small sundae topped with rich hot fudge, chocolate syrup, or strawberry topping.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>The A-La-Carte Math: Why the $7 Deal Wins</h3>
      <p>If you were to walk into a DQ Grill &amp; Chill and order these four components individually off the menu board, here is what your bill would look like in 2026:</p>
